wResult/PublisherPort/PushOutcome/TreeEntry and contract shadows plus ActivePolicy/ActMeter imports. Export-name uniqueness is limited to these conflicting contracts; no global ban. Historical findings/counts/lines below are dated at93a2552e/a6330262, not fresh current-main assertions. Reconcile with reviewed main 344656705140d9bf6539fe44de889d1e21dd2482 and credit already delivered work. All original functional groups remain owed except explicitly credited prior implementations. Schedule acts enabling jam first, then spikes needed for concrete jam work, then jam and the full67-page Artroom docs in parallel (user7363396b/04da4388). No blanket before-J2/J3/public-deployment or empty-backlog readiness gate is added; no deployment is commissioned.","body":{"conditions":"room/src/glob.ts gone and room/test/node/glob.test.ts passing against policy; a test shows room and checkers compute the same snapshot commit ID from one function; no duplicated admin constants (grep test); the cited distinct/confusing types use clear names, shared definitions or explicit import aliases while deliberate reexports and harmless package namespaces remain allowed; root gates pass; checker review.","stale_bases":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:8592926f1d4d30e3cf282eadc411dacde51d3ac0 stale; retired bases: git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:7a3bbf8f3b7ccc7ba4fd596a6bcfe5756d51a77e","target_head":"344656705140d9bf6539fe44de889d1e21dd2482","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"},"expectation":{"request":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:4fd06c76a07a8f3cecf113da3d2fc00e0a10605b","retirement":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:096c3c7a0c35e3b35724ba235c3aa8829f60fb96","promise":"absent","completion":"absent"}}